{"articleNo":"470942","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=470942&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[학적] 2024학년도 스마트공장융합전공 신규 학생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.12.14","hit":"7703","attachments":[{"name":"연계(융합)전공 이수신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=470942&attachNo=129804"},{"name":"스마트공장융합전공 교육과정 운영기준 및 편성표.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=470942&attachNo=129823"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"padding-top: 10px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">20234년도 스마트공장융합전공 학생을 모집하오니 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다.<br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 신청일: 상시모집(1월 중순까지)</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">2.</font>&nbsp;제출서류: 연계(융합)전공 이수신청서 (첨부파일 참조)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 제출처: 이메일 제출(</font>uh49@kumoh.ac.kr)&nbsp; 또는 방문&nbsp;제출(산학협력관 501호)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 지원자격</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;: 참여학과 소속 3학년 진입생 (복학예정자도 해당)</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp;• 참여학과 : 기계시스템공학과, 산업공학과, 컴퓨터공학과, 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과,</font>&nbsp;전자공학부 참여전공 (전자및전파전공, 전자IT융합전공)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">5. 혜택: 전공 이수 중인 학생들 대상 <b>교과목별 성적 우수 학생&nbsp; 인재지원금 지급</b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">6. 관련문의</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;- 스마트공장융합전공 전공장 이영실 교수&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; T. 054-478-6927&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;E-mail.&nbsp;&nbsp;youngsil@kumoh.ac.kr</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;- 스마트공장융합전공 담당자&nbsp;정의현 주무관&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;T. 054-478-6732&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;E-mail.&nbsp; uh49@kumoh.ac.kr</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
